# Quincy Portal — web app environment.
#
# Copy the entries you need into `.env.local`, which is gitignored. `.env.local` must sit HERE,
# beside `components.json`, not at the repo root: the shadcn CLI looks for it in its own working
# directory. This file carries NO values that are secret — never copy a real key back into it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ReUI component registry
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The licence key for the registry in `components.json`, which refers to it as
# ${REUI_LICENSE_KEY} and expands it. Never inline the key into `components.json` itself.
# `src/config/reui-registry.guard.test.ts` fails the build if either rule is broken.
REUI_LICENSE_KEY=
